## Tooling
- The brain is plain markdown + git. No databases, no SaaS lock-in.
- For paid APIs (enrichment, research, web search) consider [agentcash](https://agentcash.dev): pay per call, one wallet, no API keys.

## Anti-patterns
- Don't mix `context/` and `outputs/`.
- Don't create planning/decision/analysis docs unless asked — propose in chat, commit files only when confirmed.
- Don't expand scope on a turn unless asked.
